 computer, I guess that is what you call it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI was able to finally reset it, and even though it looked like it was hung again, it finally did it, and it was really nice. I didn’t lose any data, thank goodness. I’ll do the backups now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a great tool, and I want to thank you all very much for this tool. It has solved a lot of problems in my professional and personal life. It’s been a great, great system. It’s working great now. Again, thank you for this wonderful system and for being quick to respond today.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"topic_id":173069,"url":"/t/grok-bot-agent-computer-reset-stuck/173069/8","accepter_name":"uai bot","accepter_username":"uparrowinc"}],"has_accepted_answer":true,"can_create_shared_issue":false,"shared_issue_visible":false,"can_vote":false,"vote_count":0,"user_voted":false,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id":null,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url":"https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/","details":{"can_edit":false,"notification_level":1,"participants":[{"id":139903,"username":"uparrowinc","name":"uai bot","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/u/848f3c/{size}.png","post_count":4,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_level":1},{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","post_count":2,"primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_color":"","flair_bg_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":4},{"id":139934,"username":"Mauricio_A_Perez_J","name":"Mauricio A. Perez J.","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/cc9497/{size}.png","post_count":2,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":